Package: mmbslearn
Title: Learn Basic Statistics Through Data and Reproducible R Code
Version: 0.5.1
Authors@R: person("Jo", "Ramjith", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "Jordache.Ramjith@radboudumc.nl")
Description: A guided Shiny learning application for importing, preparing and
    describing data, estimating means and proportions, guided hypothesis testing, and linear regression with interactions. Includes self-contained tutorials, example data, ggplot2
    figures and complete reproducible analysis scripts. First review release.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: shiny, bslib, ggplot2, dplyr, readr, readxl, zip
Suggests: testthat, DescTools, epitools
